n R_X86_64_PC32 against .bss out of range: 2151571077 is not in [-2147483648, 2147483648)\r\nmold: error: /usr/lib/gcc/x86_64-redhat-linux/15/crtbegin.o:(.text): relocation R_X86_64_PC32 against .bss out of range: 2151571059 is not in [-2147483648, 2147483648)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146585076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146685534","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109239#issuecomment-3146685534","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109239","id":3146685534,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67jpxe","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-02T19:31:47Z","updated_at":"2025-08-02T19:46:05Z","body":"On fedora it's using GCC 15 and on github it's using GCC 11.\r\n\r\nThis issue happens because th